{
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTelly.BlushesLooksDown": "[pg]Telly blushes and looks down from your eyes. With a bright grin, she looks back up. [say: Don't forget to give Mister Bear a good-bye hug!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTelly.NiceGifts": "These bears make nice gifts, don't they? Telly certainly deserves one, you feel. You present the gift to her, receiving a head-tilting look of obliviousness."
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTelly.NothingWrong": "[pg]There's nothing wrong, you intend to give it to her as a gift. Telly bring her arms in close and smiles. [say: You paid for that, though! I encourage gifting it to someone special!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTelly.OfferRepair": "[pg][say: Is something wrong with your bear, [mister]? Telly is happy to offer repair services!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTelly.WhoSaysNot": "[pg]Who says you're not doing that now?"
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTellyForce.GigglesIncessantly": "[pg]Telly giggles incessantly at your aggressive gift-giving. [say: Thank you, [mister]. I'll be sure Mister Bear gets lots of love on your behalf.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTellyForce.GodsDamnBitch": "Gods damn this bitch, just take the damn thing."
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTellyHug.GoingAlongRequest": "Going along with her request, you grip the teddy-bear tightly to your [chest] and show off your smile to let her know you passed plenty of affection into it. Content with the effort put in, you hand it off to Telly who immediately cuddles it just as tightly."
  "Scenes.Telly.CompassionaTellyHug.ThankYouMister": "[pg][say: Thank you, [mister].]"
  "Scenes.Telly.DelicaTelly.GaspsDilating": "[pg]Telly gasps, her hazel eyes dilating as she takes the flower in her hands. [say: It's beautiful, [mister]!] The shopkeep pauses to bury her nose in it and sniff. [say: It smells so sweet and fragrant, like vanilla and roses!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.DelicaTelly.MovesToEmbrace": "[pg][say: It's such an exotic flower, thank you very much,] she says, moving forward to embrace you in a hug."
  "Scenes.Telly.DelicaTelly.PresentsDrakeHeart": "You present the Drake's Heart to Telly, making it clear that you wanted to give her something nice."
  "Scenes.Telly.DelicaTelly.TwinkleInEyes": "[pg]The twinkle in her eyes and the open-mouthed smile across her face speak volumes about her appreciation, giving you a sense of satisfaction in a gift well-chosen."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTelly.DdCupCake": "[pg]It's a DD-cup-cake."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTelly.DespiteReservations": "[pg]Despite her reservations, the demoness begins by grabbing one of the gumdrops, smearing off some of the frosting with it before popping it into her mouth and smiling. [say:It's so much sweetness to have in one sitting..! And I'd need a spoon, I can't just bi--] She stops herself. [say:Well you're not going to stop me, so I [b:can] just bite into it!] Telly lunges in and munches the cupcake, filling her mouth completely and staining her cheeks and nose with vanilla frosting. You don't believe she's as young as she looks, but right now you're doubting she's all that old, either..."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTelly.LeansInExamines": "[pg]Telly leans in as she examines the excessive pastry, and the singular candle atop ignites all on its own, illuminating her face. The circle of gumdrops sparkle as the crystals of sugar catch the light. The little shopkeeper loosely measures the size with her hands, then lowers her arms and compares it to the size of her belly. [say:[Mister], this is way too big to fit! Cupcakes are supposed to be individual-sized!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTelly.NeverFinish": "[pg][say:Don't you want some, [mister]? I'll never finish on my own, even at this rate!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTelly.PointsOutCupcake": "[pg]You point out that the cupcake is, in fact, the size of an individual."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTelly.SitsBackHappily": "While Telly happily sits back and waits for you to pick something out to buy, you instead surprise her by placing an [i:enormous] cupcake on the table, making her jolt with a [say:Woah!] as the spongy cake sinks slightly under its own weight before springing slowly back. Telly looks on in shock and awe. [say:Is that a birthday cake?] she asks. You inform her it's a cupcake--a cupcake you brought just for her! [say:It's a [b:cup]cake!? It's huge!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTellyBite.ReciprocatesAndSwipe": "[pg][say:You got something on you,] she says. You reciprocate and swipe some from her face too, provoking a giggle out of the demoness. Even together, the two of you can't finish it [if (silly){before your cosmic sense of time warns you that you have to return to camp by the start of the hour every hour|without throwing away the rest of the day}], and so you leave the demon to finish without you."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTellyBite.SetsHandsDown": "Setting your hands down on the counter for leverage, you brace yourself and lean in, biting a mouthful out of the chocolate cupcake and staining your own cheeks and nose with frosting as well. Telly reaches over, finger pointing, and swipes some of the mess from your face."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTellyDecline.DeclaresAnotherBite": "[pg][say:I accept the challenge!] she declares before taking another bite. A small bite. You'd have to crunch some numbers in your head to figure it out exactly but with a mouth as small as hers and a cake as big as this, it will take... far too long for you to sit here for. You got to see her smile, which is really the payoff for you, no need to watch her finish it."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTellyDecline.OnlyACake": "It's only a [i:cup]cake if it's for a single person to eat, so no sharing this time. It's a gift for Telly, it's up to her to eat it all by herself--she can go at it all [day] if she has to."
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTellyLick.EyesUpCupcake": "[Walking] closer, you eye up the cupcake before turning your attention and locking your lips over her nose, licking off the frosting with a smooch. Telly blushes intensely and gives a flustered [say:Hey!] before sticking her tongue out at you in playful indignation. Rather than chastise you for it, she wipes the frosting off one of her cheeks and presents her finger to you. [say:You missed some.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.DirTellyLick.SucksSweetCream": "[pg]You suck the sweet cream from her and make her giggle from the sensation, and Telly resumes eating from the cupcake. She's finishing it, just not any time soon, and despite your inclination to stick around, you have to take your leave eventually."
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.AliceCandyName": "Wonderland"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.BearHug": "bear hug"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.BeeCandyName": "bee mine"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.BromanticName": "bromantic"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.CanineCandyName": "puppy love"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.CatCandyName": "purfect"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.DitsyDarlingName": "ditsy darling"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.DryadCandyName": "sappy sapling"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.Floatiness": "[pg]There's a floatiness in your chest following her words, but you've no time to dwell on it before the shopkeeper presents a jar of tiny heart-shaped candies. [say: 25 gems!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.GooCandyName": "melt 4 u"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.HarpyCandyName": "love bird"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.HugMe": "hug me"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.IendToken": "[iend]"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.InscribedUpon": " inscribed upon it. When you look back at the jar, Telly has already set it aside, awaiting payment for the one you have taken. Though it's so small and simple, you're taken by the charm. You hand the gems to Telly, receiving a gleeful [say: Happy Valentine's Day!] as you turn to leave."
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.InsectCandyName": "love bug"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.KitsuneCandyName": "fluff me"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.NowYouKnowWhy": "Now you know why you're expecting more: she did this last Valentine's Day too! Has Telly forgotten about you? To your reminder, she giggles. [say: I know I gave you a picture last year, [mister], but I never asked to be [b:your] Valentine.] The demoness blushes slightly as she pauses. [say: Besides, you wouldn't want an{0} Alice as a Valentine.] After a moment of that remark hanging in the air, she perks back up, saying, [say: I'm just after enriching your Valentine's Day experience! Would you like something special this year too?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.PigCandyName": "hog the love"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.SheepCandyName": "love ewe"
  "Scenes.Telly.EnTellychy.WithdrawingTreat": "[pg]Withdrawing one of the treats, you read [istart]"
  "Scenes.Telly.HospiTellyty.AlongRoadTelly": "Along the road is Telly's Toys & Treats, the pale pink wagon you spotted before. Though the location is different, and the steed less enthused about the present moment, it's largely the same situation as last. Is it time to shop for this world's idea of \"toys and treats?\""
  "Scenes.Telly.HospiTellyty.InterestedInMaking": "[pg][say: Hi, [mister]! Are you interested in making a purchase today?] she says with a gleeful smile."
  "Scenes.Telly.HospiTellyty.PinkWagon": "A familiar pink wagon stands out against the otherwise unremarkable terrain. The yellow stars dotting the corners give a distinctly out-of-place childish flair in this landscape, and you ponder what others would think reading \"Telly's Toys & Treats\" as they take in such a situation. Presumably, the shopkeeper is inside."
  "Scenes.Telly.HospiTellyty.TravelsHappenUpon": "Through your travels, you happen upon Telly's wagon trudging along the beaten path people may have once called a road. She spots you from her perch on the front, slowing the horse pulling it."
  "Scenes.Telly.HospiTellyty.VagueSemblancesRoad": "Along the vague semblances of road that you manage to follow, you spot a light pink wagon, large enough to haul a fair amount of stuff. Assuming no immediate danger, you continue approaching it as you eye it up further. There's a horse tied to the front, calm and waiting patiently for when next to trot on. The side of the wagon is decorated with yellow stars, and you spot a sign on it that reads \"Telly's Toys & Treats!\""
  "Scenes.Telly.SweeTelly.LoveOfSweets": "Knowing Telly's love of sweets, she may love this peach. Furthermore, it's from such a distant and unique place that you'd bet she's never tried it."
  "Scenes.Telly.SweeTelly.RedStripedFruit": "[pg]Marveling at the red-striped fruit, she thanks you, and immediately takes a bite. [say: It's so sweet!] she exclaims, savoring the fruity flavor in her cheek. [say: It reminds me a lot of whisker fruit, but a bit less overpowering. It's really refreshing.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.SweeTelly.VariousDelights": "[pg]The shopkeeper continues making various delighted sounded while munching the fruit. [say: Thank you very much for bringing me one of these, [mister].]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyAlgia.ChimesHappily": "[pg]Telly chimes happily as she begins her art, [say: Fear not for you are in my care, and everyone knows Telly cares a lot about her customers!] "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyAlgia.ExperimentalStrokes": "[pg][say: U-uh, let's seee,] she says, making experimental strokes with her brush. [say: Oh! It works! I wasn't sure if the paint would work on something so gooey!] "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyAlgia.FinishesGrabs": "[pg]Telly finishes and quickly grabs a mirror to show you her work. [say: See! I made sure to do my best for a great customer like you! I hope you like it.] You tilt you head a bit, enjoying the {0}. [say: Remember, though, it's a pretty cheap pasty paint, it'll come off pretty easily. You're welcome to ask for another any time you'd like. It's one of Telly's treats!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyAlgia.GleefulHumming": "[pg]Gleeful humming accompanies her every motion as she follows the broader strokes with a small flat utensil to clean the edges of the shape. As Telly decorates your cheek, she idly chatters about her love for art. Any attempt you make to respond, however, is met with a warning not to move your mouth too much while she paints."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyAlgia.HandsGems": "You hand the girl her 5 gems and tell her exactly what you'd like. She ushers you to sit and immediately sets to work."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyAlgia.PaintingOnFur": "[pg][say: It's a little weird painting on fur, but I'll do my best!] "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBear.LargePile": "You check out a large pile of stuffed bears. [say: Those are authentic Telly-bears, [mister]!] Telly calls from the counter. [say: I've hugged each and every one, charging them full of love to help warm the heart of anyone needing to snuggle!] She punctuates her advertising by pressing her pinkies into her cheeks and smiling widely. [say: 50 gems if you're interested!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.CuddlyEffects": "After experiencing the cuddly effects of Telly, you are certain of the value in buying those bears! You pay the 50 gem fee without hesitation."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.FollowsSuit": "[pg]Following suit, you [walk] over and embrace the demon-girl tightly, {0}finding all your woes and worries of the world melting away. Telly's body is soft and warm, and you feel her over-joyed nature as she grips you as hard as possible. All the while her tail wags back and forth like an excited puppy's."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.FollowsUp": "[pg]She follows up her declaration by suddenly embracing you again in a much briefer and more spontaneous hug."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.LetTellyCharge": "[pg]Telly giggles. [say: Extra warm Telly-hug available just for you, [mister]! Come let Telly charge you up!] she exclaims while holding her arms out."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.MoodDims": "[pg]Telly's mood dims ever so slightly. [say: I understand. I hope you see value in any of the other products and services I offer!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.NoNeedFor": "There will be no need for that, you believe quite confidently that a direct hug is easily worth as much as the bear, and you give her {0}."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.RatherNot": "As it stands, you'd rather not take a bear right now{0}. Nevertheless, the hug was nice, and you appreciate her for it."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.ShiversGlee": "[pg]Telly shivers with glee for a moment, taking the money. [say: Thank you very much for shopping at Telly's Toys & Treats! I'll be happy to give you as many love-filled Telly-hugs as you want!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.SkillfulMerchant": "[pg][say: Thank you very much for shopping at Telly's Toys & Treats!] says the skillful little merchant."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.UponRelease": "[pg]Upon release, Telly's bright smile lights up her entire face. [say: I hope this charges you up for the whole day, [mister].] Her hands rest together at her waist, her hazel eyes rolling their gaze away. [say: But for charging yourself up while at home or on the move, these stuffed bears will give you a boost any time!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyBears.WasteToJust": "Seems like a waste to just buy the bear when you could have Telly charge you with her hugs directly. That'd be much more efficient."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.AbsorbingExposition": "[pg]After absorbing all the exposition you've given her, Telly seems nonplussed by her lack of access. [say: Tel'Adre sounds exactly like the sort of city I expect to chew me out with taxes.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.AsItHappens": "[pg]As it happens, you do, and you tell her all about [akky]. The cuddly and short-furred little housecat is a very friendly companion to have around."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.BeingAnAlice": "Being an Alice, she must have a hard time feeding. How is she able to run a shop so enthusiastically? Who is she feeding on?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.BlackAndWhite": "[pg]Black and white, she says? You didn't think demons could use white magic."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.BlushSpreads": "[pg]A blush spreads throughout her face. [say: O-oh, it's <b>this</b> kind of comic.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ChimesDemoness": "[say: You're my favorite Alice, [mister]!] chimes the demoness, out of the blue."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ClarifiesStruggling": "[pg][say: Huh? Oh, black magic is just bodily manipulation, while white is more like material stuff,] she clarifies, struggling to articulate it better. [say: Not exactly, I guess, but it's close. White is more immaterial entirely, but is really good utility with material things.] Telly groans while scratching her head. [say: I'm not a good teacher, I'm sorry, [mister].]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ConcernedTone": "[pg]In a concerned tone, Telly remarks, [say: Be careful of those fox-girls, [mister].] She glances around warily, leaning in closer to whisper, [say: I hear they even kidnap Alices to make them play dress-up for hours on end!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ConversationSteers": "Perhaps as expected, the conversation steers to sweets. Telly has quite a penchant for candies, unable to settle on any one favorite."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.DarkerThanNight": "[pg][say: [b: Black], darker than night, washed in the shadowy ink of my soul,] she replies, wide-eyed. You can almost see the smile held back in her eyes before she caves in. [say: Ha! I love that question, nobody ever asks! I love... pink. No--purple! Fuchsia!] Telly brings her hand to her chin and scrunches her brow, dwelling on the subject. [say: Blue isn't appreciated enough! Red is really passionate though!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.DemonShopkeepers": "Demon shopkeepers aren't too common in your experience, but there are some out there. The talks between you two gradually drift into that subject, and Telly brings up the Bazaar's resident seamstress, Greta."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.DemonTwirls": "[pg]The demon twirls in dramatic fashion, falling onto the bed pushed against the back of the wagon behind her. [say: All colors need their time to shiiiiiine.] She trails off."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.DiveInto": "The two of you dive into the subject of the weather. While simple small-talk where you're from, it's evidently a hotly debated subject in some circles."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.DoingToday": "So, how's Telly doing today?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.DulyNoted": "[pg]Duly noted."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ExclaimsShopkeep": "[pg][say: Oh!] exclaims the shopkeep, her tail straightening out as physical emphasis, [say: the other day, I had stopped on a path through a forest, and I saw a [b: fox!]] Telly's hands ball up into fists as she tries to hold a grip on her own excitement. [say: His fur was super soft, and he was really friendly!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ExplainsVague": "[pg][say: I know lots of basic things, mostly of body and mind effects,] she explains. A bit vague, that doesn't narrow much down. She hums a little as she rethinks her answer. [say: I know a lot of black magic, some white magic, and a lot of illusion spells.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ExpoundsTopPicks": "[pg]Telly expounds on her top picks. [say: The best flavors are bitter, salty, and savory. Chocolate, salted caramel, and butterscotch respectively!] She holds her face and drools while fantasizing of the treats."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.EyeSquishing": "[pg]Telly gives you an eye-squishing, tooth-baring grin. [say: I love animals! All you need to do is be gentle and friendly, and they'll return the favor. Do you have a favorite animal, [mister]?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.FavoriteColor": "What's Telly's favorite color?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.FitOfGiggles": "Telly breaks into a fit of giggling. [say: You're really chatty, [mister]!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.FlickingSpaded": "[say: Do you have any pets?] she asks while flicking her spaded tail excitedly."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.FoxesAvoidPeople": "[pg]Foxes tend to avoid people. Does Telly have some magical affinity with wildlife?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.GeneralTalk": "As you talk through some general topics, your eyes scan the doodle-covered counter Telly sits at. While some doodles are quite rough and silly, others are surprisingly detailed. As a whole, her art tends to be cutesy. You ask a bit about it."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.GetsBackUp": "[pg]Telly gets back up, reciprocating the question. [say: What's yours?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.HandAcross": "[pg][say: One day, I didn't have much money to spare and couldn't just go buy more materials to make more products. I had to sell what I already had first.] Telly's hand moves across a winding vine drawn over part of the counter, rubbing her finger along some of the intricate patterns sprouting off it. [say: I got bored and started scribbling.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.HappyToElucidate": "[pg]Telly, happy to elucidate, explains, [say: Where I grew up, it was normal for parents to teach their children how to perform their skills.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.HerParents": "[pg]In that case, Telly's parents worked with lacquer?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.HorrifyingFate": "[pg]Truly a horrifying fate."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.JovialCheer": "[pg][say: I smiled as soon as I woke up, and I plan to smile all day long,] Telly says with jovial cheer. [say: It would make my smile even brighter if you smile a lot today too, [mister].]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.LeansForward": "Telly leans forward with her chin resting on her hands, tail flicking playfully as she speaks of her random anecdotes."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.LetsOutChuckle": "[pg]She lets out a chuckle. [say: I keep hoping one of these days I'll say it just before someone's about to ask if I'm psychic.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.LittleDemonNods": "[pg]The little demon nods. [say: It's really cheap and easy to make, and just about any house would be better off with it. It helps insulate, support, and decorate!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.LoveCats": "[pg][say: He sounds adorable, [mister]! I love cats too, and I can never hold back from feeding strays in the off case I find them!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.MagicBroadSubject": "Magic is a fairly broad subject, and demons tend to have a grasp of some of it. How much does Telly know?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.MeanToSay": "[pg]What you mean to say is that it's a raunchy book of pornographic drawings."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.MerchantDetails": "As the merchant details the many dyes suited for coloring lacquer, you ponder how she came to learn so many crafts."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.NeedlessCurious": "[pg]Needless to say, you're curious how the two of them get along, given they both know how to sew and knit. To this line of questioning, Telly's expression wavers."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.NicePerson": "[pg][say: Not at all, [mister], you seem like a nice person.] Telly smiles at you, putting her thoughts simply. [say: You'll only hurt the bad demons.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.NoHarmDone": "[pg]No harm done."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.NoticesEdge": "The shopkeep notices the edge of your hentai comic peeking from your pack. [say: Oh! You read comics?] she asks. [say: What kind is it? Can I see?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.OptimisticOutlook": "[pg]Her optimistic outlook is refreshing. Seeing as she is so kind-hearted, might she have any insider knowledge about the demons that could aid your quest?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.OtherAlices": "Are there any other Alices that Telly knows, you wonder?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.PlacesHands": "[pg]Telly places her hands on her hips and put on a face of mock indignation. [say: I am older than I look!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.PonderDemoness": "You ponder how the little demoness makes her candies, as they're quite delightful."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.QuellExcitement": "[pg]Trying to quell her excitement, you explain it's a rather adult comic."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.QuicklyHandsBack": "[pg]The demoness quickly hands it back, looking very embarrassed about the ordeal."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.QuiteTheSense": "Telly's got quite the sense of fashion, relative to other people in this world. Does she make those clothes herself, like she does with some of the stuffed toys?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.RaisingHands": "[pg][say: I'm sorry, I'm no soldier or big deal demon,] she explains, raising her hands in claw shapes to illustrate her ferocity as a 'big bad demon'."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SatingCuriosity": "[pg]Sating the little girl's curiosity, you retrieve the comic and toss it her way. With expert agility, Telly catches and opens the book, feasting her eyes on the pages."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SaysSurprised": "[pg][say: Oh!] she says, surprised. [say: I'm sorry, I didn't mean to invade your privacy!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SaysWithGrin": "[pg][say: The only thing I have to feed on are sugary treats and smiles!] she says with a grin."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SeemsHappyTo": "[pg][say: Experimenting is a lot of fun, but sugar, water, honey, and fruit juice are the major ingredients,] she says. She seems happy to give the rough overview of the process, expounding further, [say: I boil it and try out different kinds of fruit or whatever else I feel like adding. It's really easy, and exciting to find out what you can come up with!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SheAdmits": "[pg][say: Greta really hates Alices,] she admits. [say: But she doesn't <b>do</b> anything to me, it's not that bad. Most demons expect us to be the worst, debatably lesser to imps.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SheReplies": "[pg][say: Of course, I know several!] she replies. [say: They're usually pretty happy to be around an Alice that has a home--Telly gives them hope!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.ShesADemon": "[pg]She's a demon, sure, but somehow you aren't sure she is into the kind of comic you happen to have."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SmilesBrightly": "Telly smiles brightly. [say: I like talking to you, [mister].]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.SoullessMonsters": "Demons are powerful soulless monsters exuding sexuality and might, or so you've been lead to believe. {0}hy are Alices so unlike the stereotype? "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.StaresHappily": "[pg][say: I get some of my clothes the same way other Alices do.] Telly stares happily at you as she says this, seemingly as if that answer was sufficient."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.StatesLittleGirl": "[say: As a matter of fact, yes.] states the little girl. To what, you've no idea."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.StrangeCreatures": "There are many strange creatures in this land, quite unlike the kind you knew of back in Ingnam, and the kitsunes are among the more magically adept that you've seen. You can't seem to get anywhere near one before their illusions start bearing down on your psyche."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.TellyExplains": "[pg][say: She's a big, pink succubus,] Telly explains. [say: I'm glad she found a passion to pursue besides all the sex.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.TellyReplies": "[pg][say: Magic and alchemy, [mister]!] Telly replies. [say: Really powerful stuff too! If you ever find one of those special potions, you better hope you don't drink it by accident!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.TiltsHead": "[pg]The demoness tilts her head and reminisces. [say: I meant to keep the counter professional, like a proper merchant, but then I realized I liked it! It keeps me busy whenever I'm just waiting, and it helps make my shop more 'me'!] She looks up with a prideful expression."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.TooBadTellyIs": "It's too bad Telly is a demon; there'd be quite the potential for business in the city. Unfamiliar with what you're referring to, Telly asks you to specify what city, to which you elaborate on Tel'Adre and its current situation."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.TrueMerchant": "[pg]Spoken like a true merchant."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.WandersIntoMission": "The conversation wanders into your mission, as so many conversations are wont to do. As you go over the outline of your quest to eliminate Lethice and dismantle the demonic horde, you wonder if Telly is bothered by it."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyCommunication.WasntTooBad": "[pg]It wasn't too bad of an explanation. It may not be comprehensive, but you think you got the gist of it."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscope.EyesLightUp": "[pg]Telly's eyes light up with excitement. [say: Thank you, [mister]! I love gifts!] she exclaims, swiftly undoing the binding to unfold the paper covering. The little girl takes a breath, savoring the moment as she hovers her hands over the top. [say: Wait!] she yells, moving to the room behind the counter for something."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscope.PresentsGift": "You present the demoness a gift: one square package wrapped in white paper, tied with a thin string."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscope.ReturnsWithDrum": "[pg]Telly returns with a small drum. [say: Drum-roll, please!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.AlwaysNeedDrum": "[pg][say: But [mister], exciting reveals always need a drum-roll!] she pouts. Undeterred, the shopkeep sets the drum next to her and gives it a few practice-taps with her tail. She focuses for some time, mentally preparing for the act, until soon her tail unleashes an amazing flurry of taps. It sounds like she can manage the drum-roll on her own."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.BeforeAnAnswer": "[pg]Before you manage to produce an adequate response, Telly puts her hands to her hips and declares, [say: Well to make up for that prank, you better fluff my tail!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.DisorientedBlast": "[pg]Disoriented from the blast, the little girl winces and stumbles back. [say: Ah!] is all she says. Telly rubs her face, soon gazing back at you after realizing she's fine. While showing an accusing but playful look on her face, she asks, [say: Did you prank me, [mister]?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.ExcuseYou": "[pg]Excuse you?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.FailingToContain": "Failing to contain a sigh, you deny the request and tell her to open the gift already."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.HandsRest": "[pg]Telly's hands rest on the lid of the box, her excitement obvious in her expression as the speedy tune of the drum builds. As the beat reaches its peak, Telly lifts the top off and over her head, her eyes trained on the contents within. Following closely behind its former barrier, a gust of blue smoke blows into the demon's face."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.JoyedShopkeeper": "[pg][say: Perfect!] yells the joyed little shopkeeper."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.ToBeTotally": "[pg]If you're to be totally honest, you weren't really sure what was in it, although you had some guesses. At the very least, it wasn't going to be too dangerous. {0}"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopes.WouldBeRemiss": "You would be remiss to not join in her playful nature--why else would you even visit? With as much flare as one might expect from you, you pull the little instrument close and begin tapping it in a perfectly suspense-building rhythm."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.BestFluffer": "[pg][say: You're the best fluffer I have ever had the joy of training! Represent our village far and wide, and show them what a true kitsune can do!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.ClosesShop": "[pg]With that, the Alice merchant closes the wagon. Damn mind kitsunes."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.DamnMindKitsunes": "[pg]Even with those damn mind kitsunes, she uses alliteration. Shaking your head at this nonsense, you insist that the shopkeeper has been cursed and that she does not in fact have any fluffy tails. She doesn't even have multiple tails at all."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.GesturesSeat": "[pg]The demoness gestures to the seat behind the counter, suggesting you sit. "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.HopAndSkip": "[pg]With a hop and skip, Telly {0} and turns to present her playfully-wagging tail."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.HugsKitsune": "[pg]You hug the sweet little kitsune, imparting all of your fluff into her. In turn, Telly embraces you with every ounce of might she has."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.MaintainingCare": "[pg]Maintaining a level of care and a gentle touch, you grasp the purple tail. It feels much the same as {0}, and is certainly nothing fluffy. Doing the only thing this world trains you for, you set about massaging the long, fleshy appendage. Telly, delighted, leans further back and purrs blissfully. The silky-soft strands of blonde hair rubbing against your arms as she rocks back and forth give a soothing sensation, and you note the vague scent of cherries."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.NonBiped": "Being the non-biped that you are, that wouldn't work the way her addled mind seems to think. These legs are not just fluffy tails, Telly! "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.NothingToFluff": "There is nothing to fluff on that tail! Her tail is like a leather whip with a spaded tip, there must be something wrong with her."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.NovelRequest": "While a rather novel request from her, you will do your best. "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.OurVillage": "[pg][say: Excellent work, [Mister] Kitsune! You have done our village proud, having truly mastered the art of fluffing tails!] cheers the girl. She leans forward and walks a few steps before turning back around. [say: There is only one fluffening left before you can be officially certified as the fluffer!] She tosses her arms aside, gesturing for a hug."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.RefutesClaim": "[pg]Appalled, the demoness refutes your claim. [say: Telly's Tails & Tufts have only the fluffiest of fluffs! And I'm Telly, I have tufts on my tails!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.SheCommands": "[pg][say: Fluff away!] she commands. While it's a mildly awkward position, you make haste to get a grip on the recklessly swinging whip that extends from a fold in her dress's waist. To your surprise, and concern, she jolts in place. [say: Don't be rough, [mister]! Fluffing tails is a delicate matter!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.SheSays": "[pg][say: Oh,] she says. [say: Then Telly shall bring the tail to you!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.SitsAsInstructed": "As instructed, you sit down on chair, followed quickly by Telly sitting on your lap. Her tail flicks back and forth, waving the spade with childish energy. The demon leans back, pressing her little purple wings against your body."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.StompsHer": "[pg]In a huff, Telly stomps her foot and begins pushing you toward the exit. [say: I will not stand to let you insult my tails in my kitsune village!] She stops once you're at the door, gesturing you out. [say: Don't come back again until you've collected 50 fluffy tails!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDoscopic.UshersOut": "[pg]Telly ushers you out, practically pushing you through the exit of her wagon. The door shuts behind you, and you are left to your thoughts."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDrama.ReturnsGems": "[pg]Telly returns your gems. [say: You can always come back when you have more room!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDramatic.DecidesAgainst": "Rethinking it, you decide you don't want any gunk on your face, despite the popularity of that pastime."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyDramatic.SetsPaints": "[pg]The little demon sets her paints aside with a whining [say: Awww] before returning to her seat behind the counter."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.AsSuspected": "[pg]As you suspected, there's something more to this day for her, indicated by Telly leaning over the table, placing her hands down for leverage, and coming face-to-face with you. [say: Have you ever had a Valentine, [mister]?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.DoodleCounter": "Behind the doodle-covered counter sits Telly, the perky blonde Alice."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.DoorUnlocked": "The door is unlocked, and you open it to see Telly sat happily behind her counter, sewing a torn stuffed toy. Your entry catches her attention, and she looks up with beaming excitement. [say: Welcome to Telly's Toys & Treats! I'm Telly and--and I remember you from the bazaar, [mister]!] She smiles brightly, warping the shape of the [Tellyvisual] painted on her cheek. You express similar surprise at finding her out here, so far from the caravan."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.DrawingHearts": "Playfully drawing more hearts onto her counter is Telly."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.EnterTiny": "As you enter into the tiny little shop, Telly jumps to her feet and smiles. [say: Happy Valentine's Day, [mister]!] she declares proudly. While she beams brightly at you for a response, you feel a wave of emotion pass over you, as if you can sense there's something else she has in store. Closing in toward the counter the little girl is standing behind, you reciprocate her greeting--in your own words."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.EntersShop": "As you [walk] into Telly's shop, the little demoness jumps to her feet. [say: [Mister]!] she exclaims, rushing to greet you."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.FinishesNeedle": "[pg]The girl finishes pulling the needle through the fabric in her hands, then glances up at you. [say: Oh? A customer? Hi!] she exclaims with giddy energy. [say: I didn't expect anyone way out here. Welcome to Telly's Toys & Treats, I'm Telly, and I sell toys and treats!] She skips around the counter and over to you to offer a handshake, causing you to instinctively pull back, wary to trust a demon, even one [if (isChild) {your age|so seemingly harmless}]. To this reaction, Telly giggles and explains, [say: I wouldn't hurt a customer, [mister], that's bad for business!] Stepping backwards whimsically, the merchant puts her hands behind her and adds, [say: And I'm an Alice, there's not much I could do to hurt anybody.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.GlancesUp": "[pg]The girl glances up from her work and notices you, her eyes lighting up instantly. [say: A customer! Finally!] She hops up from her seat excitedly and moves around the counter to meet you. Her dress appears to consist entirely of frills and lace as far as you're able to discern, and she seems to stand just under four feet. She reaches out and grabs hold of your hand, shaking it before you have a chance to react. [say: Welcome to Telly's Toys & Treats! I'm Telly, I sell toys and treats!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.GlancesUpAtYou": " She glances up at you and smiles. [say: Welcome back to Telly's Toys & Treats! I'm Telly, I sell toys and treats! What are you interested in today, [mister]?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.GreetTellyJumps": "[pg]You greet Telly and she jumps as she remembers something. [say:It's that time of year, [mister]! Make sure to buy lots of tricks and treats before night!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.HitWithSmell": "[pg]Immediately you are hit with the taste of cinnamon, vanilla, and butterscotch. It's sweet and savory, with that lingering hint of butter and sugar, and somehow fills you with vitality. Telly, incapable of waiting for your assessment, begins to explain the treat. [say: Flowers wilt, and I knew there was something special I could do with a Drake's Heart, so I made a butterscotch sauce!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.InsideToys": "The inside of Telly's Toys & Treats is just as colorful as its outside. On the right side there are two windows overlooking a number of boxes and drawers presumably containing excess stock or personal items, while the left side has an array of shelves being lit by the aforementioned windows. The lowest shelves hold jars of many colorful candies; the higher shelves have toys and stuffed animals, all labeled and priced. Behind the doodle-covered counter sits a small blonde girl with hazel eyes and a [Tellyvisual] painted on her cheek, seeming to be stitching something together. You're about to question what such an innocent-looking child is doing in this place before you notice small horns poking through her hair. {0}"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.InsideToysAgain": "The inside of Telly's Toys & Treats is just as colorful as its outside. On the right side there are two windows overlooking a number of boxes and drawers presumably containing excess stock or personal items, while the left side has an array of shelves being lit by the aforementioned windows. The lowest shelves hold jars of many colorful candies; the higher shelves have toys and stuffed animals, all labeled and priced. Behind the doodle-covered counter sits a small blonde girl with hazel eyes and a [Tellyvisual] painted on her cheek, seeming to be stitching something together. You're about to question what such an innocent-looking child is doing in this place before you notice small horns poking through her hair. {0}"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.InsideToysThird": "The inside of Telly's Toys & Treats is just as colorful as its outside. On the right side there are two windows overlooking a number of boxes and drawers presumably containing excess stock or personal items, while the left side has an array of shelves being lit by the aforementioned windows. The lowest shelves hold jars of many colorful candies; the higher shelves have toys and stuffed animals, all labeled and priced. "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.JustAsRemember": "Inside is just as you remember from when you've come across her wagon in your travels, and the little demoness is sitting happily behind her counter, idly doodling something onto the mess of flowers, hearts, and stars already drawn on. She glances up and begins to welcome you. [say: Welcome to Telly's Toys & Treats! I'm Telly and--the same Telly you met before! Hello again, [mister]!] she exclaims with glee. [say: I hope you're enjoying the bazaar! Would you like to buy any toys or treats?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.RetractsHand": "[pg]You retract your hand quickly, no less wary of demons when they look so innocent. Telly giggles and tells you, [say: I'm not going to hurt you, [mister]. I may be an Alice, but I'm quite happy with my life as a merchant! And let me tell you: hurting you would probably make my life here a lot more complicated; even if the guards didn't care, the other shopkeeps sure would! So you're safe with me, cross my heart!] She stands proudly, putting a hand to her chest. As much as trusting a demon sounds like a bad idea, she does make a good point. Hurting you wouldn't do much for her if she's just trying to make a living."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.ReturnsGreeting": "[pg]You return her greeting, and she begins to shiver with excitement. [say: [Mister], I made something for you!] Telly sprints behind her counter, retrieving something. In moments, she carries back a pastry roll. She offers it enthusiastically, eager to see your reaction. The dough is arranged in such a way that it bulges out with various wavy ruffles, appearing almost like a rose. It's covered in a layer of tan frosting. Unable to deny her, you take a bite."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.ReturnsToCounter": "[pg]The girl returns to her counter to continue stitching together what looks like a stuffed wolf. [say: So, would you like to buy something?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.SheSays": "[pg][say: I'm happy to share the fruits from such an exotic gift,] she says. [say: Would you like anything else while you're here, [mister]?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.SheShouts": "[pg][say:Welcome to Telly's Tricks & Treats!] she shouts. Her light blue dress and white apron twirls and bounces as she runs around the front of the counter, closing the distance. [say:I'm Telly, I sell tricks and treats!] Her bright smile deforms the [Tellyvisual] painted on her cheek, and she's the very picture of bubbly right now."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.SitsBehindHappily": "Telly sits behind her counter, happily humming away with her new Drake's Heart on display beside her."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.SitsHappily": "Telly sits happily behind her counter, still munching on the peach you gave her."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.SittingOnBed": "Sitting on a bed a short distance behind the counter is Telly, fiercely cuddling one of her stuffed toys with all her might."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.SoundsLikeDeal": "Of course, that sounds like a great suggestion. Telly grins and gestures you to head into the door in the back. As you open it and enter, you see the window above Telly's bed behind the counter open, and she slips upside-down through, landing on the pillows and blankets with a giggle. She rolls off and skips to the counter in moments."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.TailSwings": "[pg]Her thin, purple tail swings back and forth with a level of unbridled joy that only a child could muster. The pastry is delicious, you cannot deny that, if perhaps too sweet for some. You thank Telly for the present."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.ThatsWhatSheSells": "[pg]That's what she sells, so isn't \"that time of year\" all year long?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.TimeThereExplains": "[pg][say: That's a good place to do business, but it's a waste of money to spend [b:all] my time there,] she explains. Telly lifts the toy in her hand and continues. [say: I can fix stuff anywhere, and maybe find some new customers that have trouble braving the plains! And I have business dealings to make with some settlements on occasion.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.WalkIntoShop": "You walk into the colorful shop and are greeted to a range of toys and ornaments on display, and cobwebs hanging in various nooks and crannies. Beyond the doodle-covered counter sits a little blonde girl with a cute bow framed by two short purple horns. She leaps to her feet, her small demon-wings flapping to stabilize her overzealous movements."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMarket.WelcomeToToys": "[pg][say: Welcome to Telly's Toys & Treats! I'm Telly, and I sell toys and treats!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMotor.BlinksBlankly": "[pg]Telly blinks at you, blankly smiling for a moment. [say: That's quite a serious discussion, [mister]! The wagon is actually a cargo wagon I found stripped bare on one of the old roads. Since it's not meant to be lived in, it's smaller than the others. I made the lacquer myself and originally used a crude red dye I also made myself. The color faded after just a week of sunlight exposure, making it look pinkish. I like it a lot more that way! Polishing it up to look a bit nicer was after I started making money and could buy better paint.] The demoness regales you with her history with a grand amount of joy in her eyes, evidently thrilled to have someone interested in knowing what she did to get here. What of all the products, though? Candy, stuffed animals, and even her personal things for that matter?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMotor.HowGetStarted": "[pg]So how did she get started? Though not as large or lavish as some other wagons, it'd still be expensive and hard to make one like this. Her stock takes supplies and preparation, too, which is expensive. Where did all the investment capital come from?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMotor.HowWhyStart": "How--or perhaps, why--did Telly get into merchanting? Civilization is in ruins across the world, yet here she is trying to make a profit selling stuffed toys and candy."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMotor.PunctuatesPoint": "[pg][say: The world is dangerous, but that just makes it that much more important to have things that exist just to make you smile!] Telly punctuates her point by pressing her fingers up against her cheek in an exaggerated grin."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMotor.RuinedOldToys": "[pg]Pulling up ruined old toys and fabric, Telly gladly obliges your curiosity. [say: I mostly worked with sewing up ones people either threw out or wanted to pay to have fixed. I still take in old toys I find, but now I also buy materials from some other settlements. If I'm not at the Bazaar, I've either camped out somewhere safe or gone out to buy supplies from somewhere like the kanga settlement{0}.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyMotor.WorkedHard": "[pg]Telly really worked hard to get here. Still, an Alice is an Alice, and it doesn't seem like most people give her much of a break."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOperation.DeclaresAddsIn": "[pg][say: Money talks!] Telly declares. [say: Although... being an Alice isn't the same as being a demon. They turn their subordinates into Alices as a punishment,] she adds in, seeming more sheepish as she explains this, [say: as in, for being really really really bad. It doesn't matter how or why I'm like this, they confidently assume I'm nothing but trouble.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOperation.LifeAtBazaar": "How's life at the Bazaar? They seem accepting of demons {0}here, though you aren't too familiar with the business side of things."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOperation.TurnsGaze": "[pg]Telly turns her gaze to the window beside you. [say: As long as I'm making money -- which is easier in a place lots of people frequent -- they put up with me.] Shifting out of the rather somber tone, her smile brightens to its usual disposition again. [say: And when they get to know me, a lot of them are actually nice people!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOtic.CantBeAllBad": "[pg]It can't be all bad, just look how well Telly turned out!"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOtic.JovialShopkeep": "[pg]The shopkeep, though maintaining her jovial demeanor, lets out a light sigh. [say: Thank you, [mister], but on a more serious note, other Alices aren't Telly! It's a bad experience for most, not all butterflies and gumdrops; also, I don't think I could even afford--financially--to have any in stock anyway.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOtic.ShakesHeadCertainly": "[pg]Telly shakes her head. [say: Nope! I'm Telly, and I sell toys and treats; liddellium is [b: no toy] and certainly no treat!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyOtic.WouldSell": "Would Telly be able to sell you bottles of Liddellium? She's a demon and a merchant, after all."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyPhoto.JumpsAtSuggestion": "[pg]Telly jumps at the suggestion, grabbing her face-paint materials with astounding speed. [say: Absolutely, [mister]! I can paint all sorts of cute stuff, how's 5 gems sound? They're cheap paints, and it washes off easily!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyPhoto.ShopkeepTendency": "Remarking on the shopkeep's tendency to paint various shapes and symbols on her cheek, you wonder if she might be willing to paint one on your face too."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyPlasm.LargestJar": "One of the largest jars contains many different small candies. Telly excitedly speaks up to explain, [say: Those are a bunch of my home-made candies, made from my own recipe! You can buy one for just 3 gems!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyPlasmic.TossGems": "You toss a few gems to Telly and retrieve a candy from the jar, popping it in your mouth. The burst of sweetness with a hint of fruit is a nice treat that puts you in a good mood. Telly beams at your approval, delighted that you like her candy."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyPresence.WagonBears": "[pg]Another of the wagons bears a sign indicating it as \"Telly's Toys & Treats!\" The wagon itself is notably smaller than the others, painted pink with clusters of yellow stars near the corners. Although lacquered and painted well enough, there's a hint of amateur renovation to it."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyRgy.AliceMerchantTurns": "[pg][say: Everyone has a bad day every once in a while, so Telly is here with toys and treats!] The Alice merchant turns side to side, playfully spinning her dress back and forth in a mini-jig. She's certainly made for sales pitching. [say: Of course, sometimes a bad day takes a little more than a smile to brighten, but we Alices are known to hone our charisma.] A wink follows, suspiciously making you feel at ease."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyRgy.CustomersCanBe": "In any industry, customers can be really bad at times. How does Telly put up with that kind of thing?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySales.SalesPromptBreak": "{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.BlinkingFewTimes": "[pg]Blinking a few times, you feel mildly disoriented before reaching into your [pouch] and passing the currency over. Telly stows it into a small bag and sets it down, thus life imitates art. [say: Have a happy Valentine's Day, [mister]!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.CantEvenSay": "You can't even say you really know what she means, but as far as you can tell you've yet to experience it for yourself."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.CostTwentyFive": "[pg][say: 25 gems, [mister]!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.GazingOverImage": "[pg]Gazing over the image, you see it depicts the shop, much as it appears right now, with the window beside you in the background. Telly is leaning over the counter and smiling as you stand in the picture holding a sheet of paper that you are examining intently. She even has all the details of your [armor] as if you had modeled for this. You look back over the art to the demon, whose expression is just as she painted it. Marveling once more, you notice one difference between the image and the room as it really is: she painted a small bag of gems on the counter."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.GigglesLittle": "[pg]Telly giggles a little. [say: This year, I hope you'll feel like a special Valentine because of Telly's Toys & Treats.] The demoness grabs something from the floor behind her, soon presenting what appears to be paper to you. [say: It's only 25 gems, [mister]! I made it for you, with my own homemade paints.]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.HerIdeaOf": "What exactly her idea of a Valentine is, you can't be sure, but you've certainly had your own experience."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellySis.JoltOfAdulation": "[pg]With a jolt of strange adulation, you leave the shop, a pep in your [if (singleleg) {\"step\"|step}] as you go."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.AbominationTongue": "[pg]The nameless abomination flicks its tongue from a flesh-stalk, tasting your presence. The damnable horror screeches, filling your soul itself with the anguish of a billion fallen mortals. You see nothing but The End."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.BlinksAsks": "Telly blinks. [say: Where'd it go?] she asks, looking at her empty hands. She looks forward, noticing that you're holding her. [say: [Mister]?]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.FeelSenseOf": "[pg]You, too, feel a sense of awe and wonder as you peer into that starry abyss, and soon find yourself approaching and embracing Telly. Although your actions are without warning, her focus remains fixated on the gift, completely consumed by its beauty. Within her eyes, the stars move and swirl, flying through the void. All you see is the expanse, the entire world fading."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.LightBends": "[pg]Light itself bends and contorts in place. Shadowy tendrils invade your peripheral vision, and migraines push your mind to the limits of what you can take. You wince and struggle against the pain, soon opening your eyes to see a new entity of inconceivable shape and structure."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.TakesBlackGem": "[pg]Telly takes the black gem, marveling at the cosmic vista within. [say: It's gorgeous, [mister]!] she shouts, awe-struck. She rotates and examines it thoroughly, her eyes reflecting the endless expanse."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.TrekAmongDead": "After that trek among the dead and damned, you recovered an artifact of unfathomable beauty; to look into the glistening form of this gem is to gaze at all the stars above in the palm of your hands. What could never fit within your vision now rests within your grasp, and no object compares to its majesty. To whom could such beauty be given? Why, to none other than the one whose eyes share that same twinkling of stars and splendor."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStial.WitsReturning": "[pg]Your wits returning to you, you let go of the merchant. On instinct you might start trying to explain yourself, but the two of you stand silently as it comes to light just where you are. In all directions, stardust and twinkling lights sparkle in a backdrop of utter nothingness. You peer around, finding any sense of physical orientation difficult to maintain. It's as if you're moving, yet your limbs remain still."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.AppalledManners": "[pg]Appalled at your manners, the eldritch beast throws its tea in your face. You spiral off into the cosmos, gaining speed with every moment, exponentially accelerating. Everything blurs and twists, and you soon find yourself in bed."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.AsksEntity": "You ask the entity a few questions to get to know it better. In polite response, the shambling mass screeches in every language in existence. Blood begins to drip from your [ears]."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.GlanceAround": "[pg]With another glance around, you ascertain that there is quite literally nothing else you could do besides join or float aimlessly, so you wander over and take a seat beside the two of them."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.HoldsUp": "[say: Would you like some tea?] Telly asks. The demon holds up a tea-pot and cup, innocently smiling at the eldritch <i>thing</i> that encompasses the reality before you. In all the mind-bending turmoil, you could hardly remember she was here. [say: It's made from a leaf native to where I'm from, but with a special spice that gives it a hint of cherry and almonds!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.HorrorContemplates": "[pg]The horror pauses, contemplating, then elects to take a seat by a table, with Telly following suit. The demoness looks to you. [say: Come on, [mister], join us!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.NothingToGround": "As you've nothing to ground you in reality at the moment, you turn to the most concrete act that might be able to anchor you. Might this entity be interested in sexual intercourse with you and Telly?"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.SipsTea": "You sip the tea. It tastes warm, soothing, and vaguely of cherry and almonds."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStially.TailFlicking": "[pg][say: Wow, I never knew any of that!] exclaims Telly, tail flicking happily. [say: You seem like a really worldly person,] she says, delighted by the creature's stories."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStic.DespiteDemeanor": "Despite her general demeanor, Telly [i: is] a demon; she may well have an idea what the potion you found is for. You retrieve the strange phial from your [inv], asking if she can make heads or tails of it."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStic.GazingInHands": "[pg]Gazing at it in your hands, Telly looks up with an answer already. [say: That's liddellium, that's how they make more Tellies!]"
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyStic.OhThatWasQuick": "[pg]Oh, that was quick and to the point. This potion turns demons into Alices, you surmise from that."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyVision.SmallChildLike": "Telly is a small, child-like demon, standing around {0} tall. She is petite with light skin and long blonde hair ending a few inches above her waist. Telly's face has the same childish flair as the rest of her, with a round shape and pinchable cheeks. Her hazel eyes glimmer with excitement at the drop of a hat, and today she has painted a [Tellyvisual] on her cheek, further adding to her innocent style. "
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyVision.UnusualAttire": "Her unusual, but oddly fitting, attire consists of a lightly colored blue dress with a white apron, and a pretty bow between her horns. The outfit is well-kept yet well-worn."
  "Scenes.Telly.TellyVision.UsualAttire": "Her usual, and current, attire consists of a lightly colored lace dress with ruffled layers of frills on the skirt."
  "Scenes.Telly.ViTellyty.IJustHuggedYou": "[say: But [mister], I just hugged you!] she replies.[pg]Clearly she isn't charging enough, then, as you find this to be too much value to pass up. "
  "Scenes.Telly.ViTellyty.NeedMore": "Suffice to say, you need more cuddling Telly in your life. "
  "Scenes.Telly.ViTellyty.ReleasesChildish": "[pg]Soon after, you release the childish merchant, feeling very energized by the exchange."
  "Scenes.Telly.ViTellyty.RelinquishEmbrace": "Making haste, you relinquish {0}, and embrace the demoness without delay."
  "Scenes.Telly.ViTellyty.ReturnsEmbrace": "[pg]Laughing, Telly returns the embrace in full, and rubs her face against you for further cuddly-emphasis. [say: Thank you for your patronage.]"
}
